{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Just one run and we\u2019re holding a ticket out of this place. But there is a catch - not all of us will make it to the end\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.poster.avif?t=1761938759\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.webm?t=1761938759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.mp4?t=1761938759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready for a real challenge!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive powerful heavy trucks, transport deadly cargo through treacherous and unpredictable route. It's not just a ride \u2014 it's a battle against the road, circumstances, and your own nerves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9b Handle a big rig \u2014 feel the weight of every ton and every bump on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f Nitroglycerin! \u2014 carelessness can be costly. One wrong move and the cargo turns into a fireball. Beware of overheating, impacts and shaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f Rough road \u2014 narrow mountain trails, slippery bridges, bumpy roads and sudden landslides await anyone daring enough to hit the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Immersion \u2014 atmospheric sound design, interactive elements and realistic physics make every trip a tense cinematic experience. Feel like a real driver, stuck somewhere in destitution and despair, but with one last chance to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Quick sessions \u2014 they don't last long but demand maximum concentration. Perfect for those who appreciate a challenge and limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you deliver the cargo in one piece?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the ignition on and prepare for the toughest journey of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.poster.avif?t=1761938759\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.webm?t=1761938759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.mp4?t=1761938759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.poster.avif?t=1761938759\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.webm?t=1761938759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.mp4?t=1761938759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759140?t=1761938759","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/24de79c724ca3947dcf70fe32d1781a9e1